  '<p class="gd-p">Every booking starts as a request. A person checks the car and the price, then sends you an offer. Nothing is charged until you approve, sign and pay.</p><ol class="gd-flow"><li><b>1</b><span>Request</span><em>You pick a car and dates</em></li><li><b>2</b><span>Offer</span><em>We confirm the price</em></li><li><b>3</b><span>Sign</span><em>The rental agreement</em></li><li><b>4</b><span>Pay</span><em>Your card is authorized</em></li><li><b>5</b><span>Verify</span><em>Licence, selfie, coverage</em></li><li><b>6</b><span>Pick up</span><em>We hand over the keys</em></li></ol><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-find-a-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Find a car</h2><p class="gd-p">Start on carmacars.ca. You do not need to sign in to look around.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Go to <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca</span> and press <b class="gd-ui">Find a car</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Add your pickup and return dates. The list then shows the cars that are free and what the whole trip costs.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Narrow the list with Filters: type, seats, transmission and daily rate.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Open a car to see its photos, rates, what is included and its own calendar. Its car code (like CC-7F3A) is under the price: quote it when you call or chat with us, and we know the car at once.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/cars</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/880"><img src="/guides/img/public-02-cars-desktop-b6cd4fb8.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="880"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:86.1%;top:4%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:11.1%;top:56.8%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3%;top:82.3%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:34%;top:87.5%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-choose-your-dates-on-the-car-page" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Choose your dates on the car page</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Under Dates and price, tap your pickup date, then your return date. Hatched days are already booked.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Choose the Pickup time and the Return time.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Want it brought to you? Tick <b class="gd-ui">Deliver it to me</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Pick it up from me at the end</b>. Open Add-ons to add a baby seat, flowers, a full tank and more.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Check Your estimate, then press <b class="gd-ui">Request to book</b>. The add-ons you chose come with you.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/cars/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1120/760"><img src="/guides/img/public-03-car-page-desktop-73be4d63.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1120" height="760"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:24.4%;top:39.7%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:12.9%;top:68.2%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3%;top:76.2%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:97%;top:50%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>A request does not hold the car. The car is booked only once you approve the offer, sign and pay.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-send-your-request" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Send your request</h2><p class="gd-p">The request has five short steps. Your answers are saved as you go, so you can come back.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Step 1, Dates and delivery: check the car and tap your dates in the calendar.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Set the Pickup time and Return time. Any time, day or night, with at least 2 hours of notice.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Your request, on the right, shows the estimated total as you go.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/1002"><img src="/guides/img/public-04-book-1-trip-desktop-63a3738b.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="1002"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:9.2%;top:67.1%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:15.3%;top:91%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:91.1%;top:54.7%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="4"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Choose where you get the car: <b class="gd-ui">At our location</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Deliver it to an address</b> or <b class="gd-ui">At the airport</b>. Then choose where you return it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to driver details</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/942"><img src="/guides/img/public-04-book-1-trip-desktop-befba4f6.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="942"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:5.3%;top:26.2%" aria-hidden="true">4</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:61.8%;top:93.3%" aria-hidden="true">5</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="6"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Step 2, The driver: fill in your first and last name, email, mobile number and date of birth.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div class="gd-t">Someone else will drive too? Add them under Additional drivers. Each needs a G2 or G licence and signs the agreement.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">8</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to licence</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:980/1032"><img src="/guides/img/public-05-book-2-driver-desktop-7b572499.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="980" height="1032"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:30.6%;top:21.1%" aria-hidden="true">6</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:30.6%;top:64.8%" aria-hidden="true">7</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:55.6%;top:88%" aria-hidden="true">8</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="9"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">9</span><div class="gd-t">Step 3: choose your Licence class, for example Ontario G2.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">10</span><div class="gd-t">Choose how the car is covered: Option 1 (OPCF 27 on your own auto policy), Option 2 (rental coverage on your credit card) or Option 3 (the CarmaCars Protection Plan). You can change this any time before pickup. You may also see a link to RentalCoverage, a separate company&#39;s optional product. It is not issued or handled by CarmaCars and does not replace the option you choose here, and we may earn a commission if you buy it, at no extra cost to you.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">11</span><div class="gd-t">Choose the Booking type: Standard, or Non-refundable for 10% off with no refund.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">12</span><div class="gd-t">Add anything we should know in the notes, for example a flight number. If a body shop, a tow company or a friend sent you, type their name or the referral code from their card in Did someone refer you?.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">13</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to add-ons</b>. Step 4, Add-ons: tick what you want (see Add-ons below), then press <b class="gd-ui">Review request</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/1452"><img src="/guides/img/public-06-book-3-licence-desktop-22bb144e.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="1452"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:61.8%;top:11.2%" aria-hidden="true">9</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:32.2%" aria-hidden="true">10</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:50.4%" aria-hidden="true">11</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:66.9%" aria-hidden="true">12</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:71.7%;top:97%" aria-hidden="true">13</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="14"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">14</span><div class="gd-t">Step 5, Check it and send: read every line. Use Edit beside a line to change it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">15</span><div class="gd-t">Tick the box to confirm you are 18 or older and agree to the Terms of use and Privacy policy.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">16</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send request</b>. Nothing is charged and no card is needed.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/492"><img src="/guides/img/public-07-book-4-review-desktop-005f4c0b.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="492"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:24.8%" aria-hidden="true">14</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3.9%;top:59.3%" aria-hidden="true">15</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:73.7%;top:89%" aria-hidden="true">16</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="17"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">17</span><div class="gd-t">The confirmation shows your request number, for example CC-10021. Keep it for any question.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">18</span><div class="gd-t">A person checks the calendar, your dates and your place, usually within 2 hours, day or night. Your offer arrives by email and in Trips.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/755"><img src="/guides/img/public-08-book-5-sent-phone-14a99ccf.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="755"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:32.8%;top:12.3%" aria-hidden="true">17</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-upload-your-licence" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Upload your licence</h2><p class="gd-p">Right after you send your request: the front and back of your licence and a selfie holding it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the Request sent page, press <b class="gd-ui">Upload your licence</b> (or open your booking and press <b class="gd-ui">Your licence</b>).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Take each photo with your phone, or choose it. Add the licence number and expiry date if we ask: it must be valid after your return.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Rented with us before? A licence on file that is still valid is used again; nothing to upload.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">We read each photo at once. Blurry or cut off? A message asks you to take it again: do it straight away. The licence details we read are filled in for you: check them and press <b class="gd-ui">These are right</b>, or <b class="gd-ui">Change them</b>.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>You need your licence on file to accept the offer.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-the-main-driver-needs-an-ontario-licence" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The main driver needs an Ontario licence</h2><p class="gd-p">The main driver of a booking holds an Ontario licence. Drivers with a licence from elsewhere can drive as extra drivers.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">If your licence is not from Ontario, your booking shows: &quot;The main driver needs an Ontario licence. Add a driver with an Ontario licence as the main driver. You&#39;ll stay on the booking as an extra driver.&quot;</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Add main driver</b>. Enter their name, email, mobile and date of birth, then press <b class="gd-ui">Add main driver</b> again.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Upload the front and back of their licence on the same page. They get their own link to accept and sign the agreement, which names them as the main driver.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">You have an Ontario licence after all? Press <b class="gd-ui">I have an Ontario licence: upload it instead</b> and upload it.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Pickup waits until the main driver has an Ontario licence on file. Your own licence photos stay on the booking: our team still checks them for you as an extra driver.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-add-ons" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Add-ons</h2><p class="gd-p">Extras for your trip, such as a baby seat, a child or booster seat, flowers waiting in the car, a chauffeur, an umbrella, a phone charger or a full tank of gas.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the car page (under Add-ons) or in step 4 of the request, tick an add-on or use + and − for seats. The estimate shows the price at once.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Each add-on shows its price: a trip, a day (with the most for a trip) or an hour. HST is added.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Some need notice, for example flowers need 24 hours. Seats and other items show how many are left for your dates.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">A chauffeur is confirmed by our team in your offer.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">With a full tank of gas (prepaid) you can return the car at any fuel level, with no fuel charge.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-a-discount-code" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">A discount code</h2><p class="gd-p">A code from a game on the site, an offer we sent you, or from our team.</p><ul class="gd-ul"><li>On the last step of your request, type it in the promo code box. The price shows the discount at once.</li><li>Every code has a last day. You find it in the email or text that brought the code, and under Your discount codes on Your trips.</li><li>If you have not used a code, we remind you 3 days before its last day and the day before, by email and text as you chose in Profile. A code you won in a game is always reminded; a reminder of an offer comes only if you agreed to get offers, and every email has an Unsubscribe link.</li><li>A code that ended is refused with &quot;This code has expired&quot;. You can still send the request without it.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-ask-in-the-chat" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Ask in the chat</h2><p class="gd-p">The chat button sits in the corner of every page.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Press it and write your question: a car, your dates, the price, how booking works. The CarmaCars assistant answers right away with prices from our booking system.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Want a person? Press <b class="gd-ui">Talk to a person</b>. When our team is away, leave your name and email or phone with <b class="gd-ui">Send my details</b> and tick &quot;Email me a copy of this chat&quot;.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">End chat</b> when you are done. If you gave your email, a copy of the chat arrives by email.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">A price in the chat is for the dates you asked. Nothing is booked until you approve an offer, sign and pay.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-carry-on-later" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Carry on later</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Your name, email and mobile number are saved as you type them, so nothing is lost if you stop. We open an account for you with that email.</li><li>Every form that saves as you type says so under it: &quot;Saved as you type so you can pick up where you left off.&quot;, with a link to the privacy policy.</li><li>On the same phone or computer, open <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/account</span> (or the request page again) to carry on, no password needed.</li><li>We send you one email, &quot;Continue your request&quot;. One tap signs you in, confirms your email and opens your request on any device. You need it before you can accept an offer, sign or pay.</li><li>Already have an account? The form says &quot;You have an account: we sent you a sign-in link&quot;.</li></ul><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Search:</b> the <b class="gd-ui">Search</b> button at the top of every page finds cars, places, help and, once you are signed in, your own bookings by number or car.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-book-instantly-when-you-have-rented-with-us" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Book instantly when you have rented with us</h2><p class="gd-p">After a completed rental, with your licence verified and nothing owing, you can book an available car instantly: you go straight to sign and pay, without waiting for an offer.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('renter', 'during-your-trip', 'chapter', 'before-pickup', 'Plans change. You can ask for more days, ask to change dates, answer a change we suggest, or cancel, all from your booking.

## Extend your rental

1. On your booking, press **Extend**.
2. Pick how long: **1 hour**, **3 hours**, **1 day**, **3 days**, **1 week** or **1 month**. Each shows the new return, the price with the regular price struck through, and what you save. An option the car cannot take is greyed out with the reason, and the page says until when the car is free.
3. Press **Pay** to pay with your card on file. When the car is free it is approved at once and the page shows your new return. No card on file, or the card is declined? The secure payment page opens: enter a card there. Otherwise the request goes to our team, and once approved you pay on the same page.
4. For another date, open **Another date and time**, choose it, press **See the price**, then **Request extension**.

![](/guides/img/renter-11-extend-desktop-957274cc.jpg "desktop; size: 960 552; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/extend; pins: 2 34.4 62.9, 3 15.1 77.2")

> Tip: Extending costs less than being late: a day or more is 5% off, and 1 or 3 hours are 10% off the late fee. Already past your return time and still have the car? You can still extend. It counts from your original return time, and the late charges stay owed until the extension is paid.

## Ask to change dates

1. On your booking, press **Ask to change dates**.
2. Set the new pickup and return, then press **See the difference** to see what you would pay or get back.
3. Press **Ask to change dates** to send it. Nothing changes until you agree to our answer.

![](/guides/img/renter-12-change-desktop-09f6b563.jpg "desktop; size: 960 552; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/change; pins: 2 15.1 91.8")

## A change we suggest

Sometimes we need to change your booking, for example another car of the same class. You decide.

1. You get an email, and your booking says "We suggest a change to your booking". Press **Review and answer**.
2. Read what changes (before and after), the reason, the money and the time left to answer.
3. To agree, press **Accept and sign the amendment**, sign, then press **Accept and sign**.
4. Anything more to pay is charged to your Card on File. If the card is declined, press **Pay and apply the change**.
5. To say no, press **Decline this change**. Your booking stays as it was.

> Tip: You have 48 hours to answer, and we send one reminder. CarmaCars signs the amendment at the moment you sign it, and the signed copy is saved under Documents. If the change costs less, the refund goes back to your card within 10 business days after the amendment is signed.

## Cancel a booking

1. On your booking, press **Cancel booking**.
2. Read What you get back. It shows the rule that applies and your refund.
3. Type the booking number to confirm (for example CC-10021), then press **Cancel booking**.

![](/guides/img/renter-13-cancel-desktop-d0bb2c67.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 692; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/cancel; pins: 2 36.1 67.2, 3 95.8 45.1")

| Standard booking: when you cancel | Refund of what you paid |
| --- | --- |
| Within 24 hours of booking, and 48 hours or more before pickup | 95% back |
| 48 hours or more before pickup | 75% back |
| 24 to 48 hours before pickup | 50% back |
| Less than 24 hours before pickup | No refund |

A Non-refundable booking gets no refund. The deposit is taken at pickup, so none is held when you cancel before it.

## Messages, tolls and tickets

- On a rental of 2 days or more we check in after the first day: "How is the car?" If anything is off, reply to the email or text, or call us.
- Write to us about a booking at the bottom of its page: type in Your message and press Send.
- Tolls and tickets are yours to pay, including Highway 407 ETR. If one reaches us, we pay it and charge the amount plus our fee to your Card on File, and email you a copy of the notice.
- Running late? Extend in your booking, even after the return time while you still have the car, or call us at 289-312-5991. The late fee is 17.5% of the daily rate for each started hour (at least $25) after a 30 minute grace.
- Before your return we remind you: the day before, about 3 hours before (with an Extend link) and at the return time. If the car is late we send a notice at 15 minutes and a final notice at 2 hours. No late notices between 10 pm and 7 am.
- Already brought the car back but still getting late notices? Tap **I''ve returned the car** in the notice, or press it on your booking. Add photos of the car where you left it (pick several at once from your camera roll), the odometer, the fuel level and the time you returned it: all optional. The late notices stop at once while we check. When we confirm, your trip is complete. If we cannot find the car, we tell you why and the notices start again.
- Something wrong with the car? While you have it, press **Report a problem** on your booking: it calls roadside help, or opens a message to us.
- Someone else will drive too? Press **Add a driver**: write their name in the message and we add them; they sign with their own link.

## Return the car yourself (release 28)

**Return the car yourself** on your booking: photos of the car where you left it, the odometer, the fuel and the time. With all of them your trip is completed at once and any late notices stop; we may still adjust the readings after we see the car.

## Report an accident

While you have the car, the **Accident card** on your booking has **Report an accident**. Anyone hurt? Call 911 first.

1. Say what happened, when (empty means now) and where: type it or press **Use my location**.
2. Add photos and videos from your camera roll: all the cars, the plates, the damage and the scene.
3. Add the other party''s name, phone, plate and their insurer, and the police report number if there is one.
4. Answer **Is anyone hurt?** and **Can the car be driven?**, then press **Send the report**.

Your answers stay on your phone as you type until you send them. Once sent, our team has it at once and calls you; the page shows the next steps, **Call us**, and lets you add more photos or videos.

## Extend at the same rate (release 35)

An extension costs the same a day as your booking, and per-trip fees such as the Protection Plan are charged for the added days at the same rate. Delivery is never charged again. The price shows before you ask.', 'During your trip', 'Extend, change dates, answer a change we suggest, or cancel.',
  'Plans change. You can ask for more days, ask to change dates, answer a change we suggest, or cancel, all from your booking.

## Extend your rental

1. On your booking, press **Extend**.
2. Pick how long: **1 hour**, **3 hours**, **1 day**, **3 days**, **1 week** or **1 month**. Each shows the new return, the price with the regular price struck through, and what you save. An option the car cannot take is greyed out with the reason, and the page says until when the car is free.
3. Press **Pay** to pay with your card on file. When the car is free it is approved at once and the page shows your new return. No card on file, or the card is declined? The secure payment page opens: enter a card there. Otherwise the request goes to our team, and once approved you pay on the same page.
4. For another date, open **Another date and time**, choose it, press **See the price**, then **Request extension**.

![](/guides/img/renter-11-extend-desktop-957274cc.jpg "desktop; size: 960 552; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/extend; pins: 2 34.4 62.9, 3 15.1 77.2")

> Tip: Extending costs less than being late: a day or more is 5% off, and 1 or 3 hours are 10% off the late fee. Already past your return time and still have the car? You can still extend. It counts from your original return time, and the late charges stay owed until the extension is paid.

## Ask to change dates

1. On your booking, press **Ask to change dates**.
2. Set the new pickup and return, then press **See the difference** to see what you would pay or get back.
3. Press **Ask to change dates** to send it. Nothing changes until you agree to our answer.

![](/guides/img/renter-12-change-desktop-09f6b563.jpg "desktop; size: 960 552; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/change; pins: 2 15.1 91.8")

## A change we suggest

Sometimes we need to change your booking, for example another car of the same class. You decide.

1. You get an email, and your booking says "We suggest a change to your booking". Press **Review and answer**.
2. Read what changes (before and after), the reason, the money and the time left to answer.
3. To agree, press **Accept and sign the amendment**, sign, then press **Accept and sign**.
4. Anything more to pay is charged to your Card on File. If the card is declined, press **Pay and apply the change**.
5. To say no, press **Decline this change**. Your booking stays as it was.

> Tip: You have 48 hours to answer, and we send one reminder. CarmaCars signs the amendment at the moment you sign it, and the signed copy is saved under Documents. If the change costs less, the refund goes back to your card within 10 business days after the amendment is signed.

## Cancel a booking

1. On your booking, press **Cancel booking**.
2. Read What you get back. It shows the rule that applies and your refund.
3. Type the booking number to confirm (for example CC-10021), then press **Cancel booking**.

![](/guides/img/renter-13-cancel-desktop-d0bb2c67.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 692; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/cancel; pins: 2 36.1 67.2, 3 95.8 45.1")

| Standard booking: when you cancel | Refund of what you paid |
| --- | --- |
| Within 24 hours of booking, and 48 hours or more before pickup | 95% back |
| 48 hours or more before pickup | 75% back |
| 24 to 48 hours before pickup | 50% back |
| Less than 24 hours before pickup | No refund |

A Non-refundable booking gets no refund. The deposit is taken at pickup, so none is held when you cancel before it.

## Messages, tolls and tickets

- On a rental of 2 days or more we check in after the first day: "How is the car?" If anything is off, reply to the email or text, or call us.
- Write to us about a booking at the bottom of its page: type in Your message and press Send.
- Tolls and tickets are yours to pay, including Highway 407 ETR. If one reaches us, we pay it and charge the amount plus our fee to your Card on File, and email you a copy of the notice.
- Running late? Extend in your booking, even after the return time while you still have the car, or call us at 289-312-5991. The late fee is 17.5% of the daily rate for each started hour (at least $25) after a 30 minute grace.
- Before your return we remind you: the day before, about 3 hours before (with an Extend link) and at the return time. If the car is late we send a notice at 15 minutes and a final notice at 2 hours. No late notices between 10 pm and 7 am.
- Already brought the car back but still getting late notices? Tap **I''ve returned the car** in the notice, or press it on your booking. Add photos of the car where you left it (pick several at once from your camera roll), the odometer, the fuel level and the time you returned it: all optional. The late notices stop at once while we check. When we confirm, your trip is complete. If we cannot find the car, we tell you why and the notices start again.
- Something wrong with the car? While you have it, press **Report a problem** on your booking: it calls roadside help, or opens a message to us.
- Someone else will drive too? Press **Add a driver**: write their name in the message and we add them; they sign with their own link.

## Return the car yourself (release 28)

**Return the car yourself** on your booking: photos of the car where you left it, the odometer, the fuel and the time. With all of them your trip is completed at once and any late notices stop; we may still adjust the readings after we see the car.

## Report an accident

While you have the car, the **Accident card** on your booking has **Report an accident**. Anyone hurt? Call 911 first.

1. Say what happened, when (empty means now) and where: type it or press **Use my location**.
2. Add photos and videos from your camera roll: all the cars, the plates, the damage and the scene.
3. Add the other party''s name, phone, plate and their insurer, and the police report number if there is one.
4. Answer **Is anyone hurt?** and **Can the car be driven?**, then press **Send the report**.

Your answers stay on your phone as you type until you send them. Once sent, our team has it at once and calls you; the page shows the next steps, **Call us**, and lets you add more photos or videos.

## Extend at the same rate (release 35)

An extension costs the same a day as your booking, and per-trip fees such as the Protection Plan are charged for the added days at the same rate. Delivery is never charged again. The price shows before you ask.

## Secondary contact and rideshare documents

Open **More** on your booking page:

- **Secondary contact**: someone we may call if we cannot reach you, for this trip or on your profile. Optional.
- **Rideshare or delivery documents**: driving for Uber, Lyft, DoorDash, Uber Eats, Instacart or another platform? Pick the platforms and print the documents they ask for: your rental agreement, a coverage letter and a vehicle letter.
